    "body": "**Ready for review.** The contributor checked it in the GUI, in a build combining this PR with #162 and #244 (local only). With **G54 Z on the stock top**, Milling 2D → 2D Contour created *2D Contour2* on the first click (status: \"operation 2D Contour2 created\"). Its Heights tab showed Bottom Z = *Bottom of model* + 0 (Z 0.0000, the part's floor) and Top Z = *Top of model* + 0. Before this fix, the same setup was refused (\"must cut downward…\").\n\nGate and pinning tests are as in the description. Note for whoever merges: this PR and #244 each add a `#[cfg(test)] mod …;` line at the same place in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/mod.rs`. The second to merge needs a one-line keep-both resolution.",
